<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">I noticed that you haven't taken your next steps to enroll at Arizona State University, and I wanted to follow up to see if you still plan to attend.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The May 1 priority deadline to pay the enrollment deposit has passed, but you can still <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/deposit">submit your enrollment deposit</a>. I encourage you to do so as soon as possible to secure your place in the incoming class. Once you pay the enrollment deposit, you can confirm your housing preferences and sign up for orientation to register for classes.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you are no longer considering Arizona State University, please <a href="https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions">decline your admission</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions about the admission process or ASU in general, I'd be happy to help!&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>